msgid "Kydux"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A game of the Kidux family for learning to program in Python: a young wizard "
"arrives at a school of magic, and every step there is taken by writing "
"Python code. A fun story, short lessons and levels solved with a small "
"program, with help so as not to get stuck. Free, in English and Spanish, "
"with no account. Requires internet."
